+# Presidio PII Redaction Checklist
+
+1. Deploy Presidio Analyzer & Anonymizer in k8s (k8s/presidio/presidio-deploy.yaml).
+2. Configure recognizers and custom entity rules for your domain (PII patterns, company-specific IDs).
+3. Test scan endpoint with tests/adversarial/corpora/pii_samples.txt.
+4. Configure anonymizer behavior: mask vs substitute vs remove, and ensure anonymizer returns redacted text quality acceptable to stakeholders.
+5. If storing originals:
+   - Encrypt originals with KMS (scripts/encrypt_and_store_original.sh)
+   - Store in restricted bucket with narrow IAM principals
+   - Record pointer and access approvals in MCP via A2A approver
+6. Audit: regularly sample redactions and verify no PII leakage in training datasets.
